{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to know your truck in a brand new way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Celebrate Star Trucker\u2019s 1st Anniversary with a fully illustrated Owner\u2019s Manual packed with tips and insights for both rookie haulers and seasoned veterans. The perfect companion for truckin\u2019 among the stars\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inside you'll find:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 A dashboard breakdown</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Essential pre-trip checks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Docking &amp; hitching procedures</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 System schematics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Truck maintenance tips</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019ve also provided a CB chatter cheat sheet to provide some insight into the ten codes and slang used by characters throughout the Star Trucker universe, alongside a galaxy map for planning those long hauls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Note: This is a celebratory DLC and contains no gameplay features. Available in English only.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3933200?t=1757062313","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3933200?t=1757062313","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933200/0a8a17bb61a472ceba3a73cc876c350c904d10f1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757062313","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933200/0a8a17bb61a472ceba3a73cc876c350c904d10f1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757062313","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"cont